{"seq":1,"slug":"cross-region-index-sync","title":"索引/快照跨区域复制与延迟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multiregion-search-architecture/index-replication/cross-region-index-sync","wordCount":2578,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"索引-快照跨区域复制与延迟\">索引/快照跨区域复制与延迟</h1><p>搜索引擎的索引不是一个可以被原地追加修改的文件，而是一组<strong>不可变的 segment</strong>：每次刷新产生新 segment，后台合并把多个小 segment 合成大 segment 并丢弃原文件。这个结构与数据库的 WAL 或行级复制有本质差异——数据库可以逐行重放 binlog，而索引的&quot;一行变更&quot;在物理上意味着&quot;某个 segment 被一个新 segment 替代，同时若干其他 segment 被合并成新的&quot;。理解复制在 segment 这一层意味着什么，是设计跨区域同步机制的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨区域索引同步的目标不是&quot;让两份索引完全相同&quot;，而是&quot;让两份索引在可接受的延迟内收敛到同一状态&quot;。这个目标包含四个必须同时定义的量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>业务含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复制单元</td>\n<td>同步的最小数据粒度</td>\n<td>决定带宽与一致性保证的强度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复制延迟</td>\n<td>从源写入到目标可见的时间</td>\n<td>用户感知到的&quot;更新生效时间&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收敛保证</td>\n<td>最终是否必然一致、以何种规则一致</td>\n<td>决定是否需要冲突处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复点</td>\n<td>中断后从何处续传</td>\n<td>决定恢复时间与数据损失上界</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这四个量互相约束：更小的复制单元（如逐条变更）带来更低的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{apply}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 但需要目标区域具备重建能力；更大的复制单元（如 segment 文件）保证字节一致但禁止区域间结构差异。因此&quot;选哪种复制方式&quot;没有通用答案，取决于各区域索引是否允许有结构差异、以及目标区域是否具备独立构建能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  S[源区域索引] --&gt; U{复制单元}&#10;  U --&gt;|变更流| C[目标区域自行重建]&#10;  U --&gt;|segment 文件| F[目标区域直接装载]&#10;  U --&gt;|全量快照| N[目标区域整体替换]&#10;  C --&gt; R[收敛到同一逻辑状态]&#10;  F --&gt; R&#10;  N --&gt; R\">graph LR\n  S[源区域索引] --&gt; U{复制单元}\n  U --&gt;|变更流| C[目标区域自行重建]\n  U --&gt;|segment 文件| F[目标区域直接装载]\n  U --&gt;|全量快照| N[目标区域整体替换]\n  C --&gt; R[收敛到同一逻辑状态]\n  F --&gt; R\n  N --&gt; R</pre><h2 id=\"复制什么-三种可选的复制单元\">复制什么：三种可选的复制单元</h2><p>跨区域同步没有唯一正确的粒度，三种单元的成本与延迟特性完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>复制单元</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>单次数据量</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变更流（CDC）</td>\n<td>商品变更事件，目标区域自行重建</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>各区域索引结构一致、可自行构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>segment 文件</td>\n<td>已构建好的倒排/向量 segment</td>\n<td>中到大</td>\n<td>各区域索引结构完全一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量快照</td>\n<td>完整索引镜像</td>\n<td>极大（GB 到 TB）</td>\n<td>新区域初始化、灾难恢复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>变更流复制</strong>把商品变更（新增、修改、下架）作为事件推送到各区域，每个区域用自己的构建流程生成索引。它的优点是带宽极省、天然支持各区域索引结构差异（比如某区域用不同的分词器），缺点是各区域的索引<strong>构建过程必须幂等且可重放</strong>，否则同一个变更事件在不同区域会产出不同索引；同时每个区域都要付出完整的构建算力，如果有七个区域，就等于把索引构建成本乘以七。</p>\n<p><strong>segment 文件复制</strong>把主区域构建好的 segment 直接传到其他区域。带宽开销比变更流大一个数量级，但消除了各区域重复构建的成本与差异风险——各区域索引在字节层面完全一致，因此查询结果也完全一致（前提是排序特征也一致）。代价是各区域无法拥有结构差异：某区域想换分词器，就必须在本地重建，segment 复制路径随之失效。</p>\n<p><strong>全量快照复制</strong>只在初始化与灾难恢复时使用。它的关键指标不是带宽而是<strong>恢复时间</strong>——一个 500 GB 的索引快照跨洋传输加装载，实测可能需要数小时，这决定了新区域上线的周期。</p>\n<p>实践中常见组合是：初始用全量快照建立基线，之后持续走增量路径（变更流或 segment），并保留定期的全量校验（用快照的哈希校验两侧索引是否漂移）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量复制的延迟构成\">增量复制的延迟构成</h2><p>&quot;复制延迟&quot;这个数字经常被当作单一指标汇报，但它由四段异质的时间组成，瓶颈在哪一段决定了优化方向完全不同。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{repl} = T_{produce} + T_{transmit} + T_{apply} + T_{visible}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型量级</th>\n<th>主要优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{produce}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>源区域产出可复制的变更到落盘</td>\n<td>毫秒到秒</td>\n<td>减小 refresh 间隔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{transmit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>跨区网络传输</td>\n<td>百毫秒到秒</td>\n<td>压缩、专线、并行分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{apply}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>目标区域装载/重建索引</td>\n<td>秒到分钟</td>\n<td>增量装载、避免全量 rebuild</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{visible}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>目标区域刷新使改动对查询可见</td>\n<td>秒</td>\n<td>单个 refresh 周期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[源区域写入] --&gt; B[refresh 产生 segment]&#10;  B --&gt; C[压缩 + 上传]&#10;  C --&gt;|跨区链路| D[目标区域下载]&#10;  D --&gt; E[装载/合并]&#10;  E --&gt; F[refresh 使可见]&#10;  B -.-&gt;|T_produce| C&#10;  C -.-&gt;|T_transmit| D&#10;  D -.-&gt;|T_apply| F\">flowchart LR\n  A[源区域写入] --&gt; B[refresh 产生 segment]\n  B --&gt; C[压缩 + 上传]\n  C --&gt;|跨区链路| D[目标区域下载]\n  D --&gt; E[装载/合并]\n  E --&gt; F[refresh 使可见]\n  B -.-&gt;|T_produce| C\n  C -.-&gt;|T_transmit| D\n  D -.-&gt;|T_apply| F</pre><p>在这四段中，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{apply}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 最容易被低估。如果目标区域对每批变更都执行一次 segment 合并，合并的 I/O 与 CPU 开销会随变更频率上升而爆炸，实际表现是复制延迟随写入量非线性恶化。正确的做法是让目标区域把变更先落到一个小的&quot;近实时&quot;索引，等积累到阈值再合并进主索引——把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{apply}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从&quot;每次变更的合并成本&quot;变成&quot;每批变更的合并成本&quot;。</p>\n<p>同样值得注意的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{visible}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：即便数据已经完全装载，搜索引擎也只在下一次 refresh 时才让它对查询可见。因此目标区域的实际可见延迟至少是复制延迟加上一个 refresh 间隔，这个常数项在低延迟场景下不可忽略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"端到端延迟的实测与告警\">端到端延迟的实测与告警</h2><p>复制延迟必须被当作<strong>一级业务指标</strong>而不是运维指标来测量，因为用户直接感知它——它决定了&quot;刚改的价格多久生效&quot;。</p>\n<p>测量方法上，最可靠的做法是<strong>埋入可追踪的哨兵</strong>：在主区域周期性地写入一个带时间戳的合成文档（不影响业务，或直接使用真实变更中最新一条的时间戳），在目标区域查询该文档的最新时间戳，两者之差即为端到端复制延迟。这个测量覆盖了全部四段耗时，且不受各区域时钟偏差影响（因为比较的是源侧写入的单调时间戳，只需保证比较基准一致）。</p>\n<p>告警阈值的设定要与业务容忍度对齐，而不是与&quot;技术上可能的极限&quot;对齐：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>P50 复制延迟</strong>反映常态健康度，典型电商场景可容忍数十秒。</li>\n<li><strong>P99 复制延迟</strong>反映尾部，直接影响&quot;用户看到旧价格&quot;的投诉率。</li>\n<li>**最大延迟（max）**反映背压与卡死，需要单独告警——很多复制故障的第一个信号不是平均值上升，而是某个分片的延迟单独飙高。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个易被忽略的问题是<strong>复制延迟的区域不对称</strong>。从主区域到各区域的链路质量不同，A 区可能始终比 B 区慢，这不是故障而是物理事实。如果监控只报全局平均值，B 区的健康会掩盖 A 区的持续劣化。正确做法是按 <code>(source_region, target_region)</code> 二维切分告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复制链路的背压与恢复\">复制链路的背压与恢复</h2><p>跨区复制最危险的状态不是&quot;慢&quot;，而是&quot;停下来之后积压&quot;。当目标区域因为重启、装载变慢或磁盘满而停止消费时，变更流会在源侧堆积；一旦目标区域恢复，它会试图一次性消费全部积压，这个洪峰会再次压垮它，形成反复的重启—积压—雪崩循环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[源区域变更流] --&gt; Q[跨区队列]&#10;  Q --&gt; T[目标区域消费者]&#10;  T --&gt;|慢| Q&#10;  Q --&gt;|积压超阈值| M[触发保护]&#10;  M --&gt; D1[丢弃可重建的中间变更&lt;br/&gt;只保留最终态]&#10;  M --&gt; D2[降速/暂停写入侧]&#10;  M --&gt; D3[切换为全量快照重放]&#10;  T --&gt;|恢复| C[积压清零]\">graph TD\n  S[源区域变更流] --&gt; Q[跨区队列]\n  Q --&gt; T[目标区域消费者]\n  T --&gt;|慢| Q\n  Q --&gt;|积压超阈值| M[触发保护]\n  M --&gt; D1[丢弃可重建的中间变更&lt;br/&gt;只保留最终态]\n  M --&gt; D2[降速/暂停写入侧]\n  M --&gt; D3[切换为全量快照重放]\n  T --&gt;|恢复| C[积压清零]</pre><p>三条可用的保护策略各有代价。<strong>折叠中间变更</strong>——对于商品数据，同一商品在积压期间的多次修改只保留最后一次，中间态可以直接丢弃。这在商品场景极其有效，因为绝大多数变更是幂等的状态覆盖而非增量累加；但如果变更语义是增量（比如&quot;库存减 1&quot;），折叠就会算错，必须改为携带绝对值的状态同步。<strong>限制写入速率</strong>——反向对源区域的写入限流，好处是不会丢数据，坏处是可能影响源区域业务。<strong>切换为全量快照</strong>——放弃增量直接重放最新全量，恢复最快但带宽成本最高，适用于积压量大到增量重放已经不划算的情况。</p>\n<p>选哪一条取决于数据语义：<strong>状态型数据优先折叠</strong>（商品属性、价格、可售性都是状态），<strong>事件型数据必须保序不可折叠</strong>（订单、点击流）。这个区分与区域切分直接相关——全球一致层是可折叠的状态数据，区域本地层是独立状态数据，严格驻留层是必须保序的事件数据（见 <a href=\"regional-catalog-slice\">按区域切分目录与本地化覆盖</a>），而折叠之后是否会被并发写入覆盖，则由收敛规则决定（见 <a href=\"conflict-eventual\">多区域写入冲突与最终一致</a>）。另外，哪些数据被允许跨区复制本身就是合规问题，链路的合法性边界见 <a href=\"../data-sovereignty/data-residency\">数据驻留法律与区域隔离</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>索引由不可变 segment 组成，这使&quot;增量复制&quot;无法沿用数据库逐行重放模型，必须理解 refresh 与 merge 的物理语义。</li>\n<li>三种复制单元各有适用面：变更流省带宽但成本乘区域数、segment 复制保证字节一致但禁止结构差异、全量快照只用于初始化与恢复。</li>\n<li>复制延迟由生产、传输、装载、可见四段组成，装载段最易被低估，其成本随写入频率非线性上升。</li>\n<li>端到端延迟测量应使用带时间戳的哨兵文档，并按 <code>(source, target)</code> 二维切分告警，避免区域间不对称被平均值掩盖。</li>\n<li>复制链路的真实风险是&quot;恢复时的积压洪峰&quot;，需要折叠中间变更、限流写入或切换全量三类保护，选择依据是数据是状态型还是事件型。</li>\n<li>状态型数据可安全折叠（商品属性天然如此），事件型数据必须保序，这一区分决定了保护的可行性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"索引/快照跨区域复制与延迟","id":"索引-快照跨区域复制与延迟"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"复制什么：三种可选的复制单元","id":"复制什么-三种可选的复制单元"},{"level":2,"text":"增量复制的延迟构成","id":"增量复制的延迟构成"},{"level":2,"text":"端到端延迟的实测与告警","id":"端到端延迟的实测与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"复制链路的背压与恢复","id":"复制链路的背压与恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"边缘缓存与热门查询全球分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multiregion-search-architecture/global-topology/edge-caching-geo"},"next":{"title":"按区域切分目录与本地化覆盖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multiregion-search-architecture/index-replication/regional-catalog-slice"}}